# Oracle 11.2.0.2 XE's reply to OCI 11.2's AQ dequeue (#2805): the message
# 'hello AQ' with priority 7, expiration 3600, correlation 'CORR1'.
# Captured 2026-11-26 through tools/capture_proxy.py. The TTC payload,
# without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column
# and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  08 01 00 07 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 10 0e 00 00 05  |................|
00000010  00 00 00 05 43 4f 52 52  31 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |....CORR1.......|
00000020  00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00  00 07 78 7e 0b 1a 13 21  |..........x~...!|
00000030  02 00 00 00 00 04 00 00  00 16 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000040  00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 41 00 00 00  |..@.........A...|
00000050  00 00 00 00 00 00 42 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |......B.........|
00000060  45 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |E...............|
00000070  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 0c 00 00 00 01 04  0c 00 00 00 08 68 65 6c  |.............hel|
00000090  6c 6f 20 41 51 61 32 52  43 74 ab 52 47 e0 60 a8  |lo AQa2RCt.RG.`.|
000000a0  c0 96 00 a5 e0 09 02 00  00 00 0d 00              |............|
